     /// A bitmap that keeps track of free/used frames.
     bitmap: Bitmap,
     /// Per-frame reference count. Indexed by frame number.
     ///
     /// Invariants:
     ///
     /// - `refcount.len() >= bitmap.number_of_bits()`.
     /// - `refcount[i] >= 1` iff bit `i` is set in `bitmap` (for `i < bitmap.number_of_bits()`).
